            <div type="edition" xml:space="preserve">
                <ab>
                   <lb n="1"/>Ε
                   <lb n="2" break="no"/>τελειώθη ἡ πα
                   <lb n="3" break="no"/>ροῦσα πυ<hi rend="ligature">λη</hi> <date from="1566-09-01" to="1567-08-31">ἐ
                   <lb n="4" break="no"/>ν ετει <num value="7075"><hi rend="supraline">ˏζοε</hi></num></date>
                   <lb n="5"/><hi rend="ligature">ἡγ</hi>ουμενευον
                   <lb n="6" break="no"/>τος οἰκ<hi rend="ligature">τρ</hi><hi rend="ligature">οῦ</hi> <persName type="attested" ref="#pers16">Μα
                   <lb n="7" break="no"/>ξίμου</persName> ·:· <num value="70">Ο</num><num value="9"><hi rend="supraline">Θ</hi></num><num value="600"><hi rend="supraline">Χ</hi></num>
                   <lb n="8" break="no"/><num value="900"><hi rend="supraline">ϡ</hi></num><num value="5">Ε</num><num value="50"><hi rend="supraline">Ν</hi></num><num value="700"><hi rend="supraline">Ψ</hi></num><num value="90">Ϟ</num><num value="30">Λ</num><num value="600"><hi rend="supraline">Χ</hi></num>
                   <lb n="9" break="no"/><num value="700"><hi rend="supraline">Ψ</hi></num><num value="30">Λ</num><choice><corr>Εϡ</corr><sic><num value="900"><hi rend="supraline">ϡ</hi></num><num value="5">Ε</num></sic></choice><num value="7">Ζ</num>ΟΝ
                   <lb n="10" break="no"/><num value="80"><hi rend="supraline">Π</hi></num><num value="9"><hi rend="supraline">Θ</hi></num><num value="90"><hi rend="supraline">Ϟ</hi></num><num value="90">Ϟ</num><num value="200"><hi rend="supraline">C</hi></num><num value="9">Θ</num>ΩΘ
                </ab>
            </div>
            <div type="apparatus">
                <p>The second part of the inscription is encrypted and each letter is treated as a numeral. The substitution code is based on subtractions from 10 (for values 1-9, i.e., Α-Θ), 100 (for values 10-90, i.e., Ι-Ϟ), or 1000 (for values 100-900, i.e., Ρ-ϡ). Thus, the final part reads <persName type="attested" ref="#pers17">Λαυρεντίου</persName> τὸ ἔργον καὶ <persName type="attested" ref="#pers18">Ἰωάσαφ</persName></p>
            </div>
